# Frame-rate calibration for GTADOS/GTA8.EXE against the arena overlay.
# Holds Up across ~1.5 emulated seconds while capturing every VGA frame so
# we can measure the true game-frame rate at different DOSBox-X --cycles values.
3500 tap esc 80
+2000 tap enter 80
+3000 tap enter 80
+1500 tap enter 80
+2000 tap enter 80
19500 shot cal_before
20000 down up
+0 burst walk 105 0
+1600 up up
+200 shot cal_after
+200 quit
